# Ovika, Enigma Goliath: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, create X ... Goblin tokens". Only the controller's noncreature
# spells count. Bot1 casts Ovika on turn 1, then a third Black Lotus (mana value 0, so it makes nothing either way). On turn 2 Bot2
# casts Brainstorm (mana value 1, a noncreature spell, but not Bot1's): no Goblin. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Grizzly Bears (mana value 2, a
# creature spell): no Goblin. Bot1 ends with Mountain, Ovika and Bears alone.

